WHAT IT DOES                                                                                                                                     Trace snapshot - confirmed scope, unresolved gaps, insufficient mass balance
- Ingests supported text, CSV/TSV, Excel, EML, logs and text-selectable PDF.                                                                                                                                                                                          18 Oct 2026
- Uses local Meta Llama 3.2 3B to propose candidate facts; deterministic code handles structured parsing and traversal.
- Keeps value-in-quote, adjacent-line context, identifier-only and unlocated claims distinct; humans confirm relationships.
- Separates confirmed scope from possible exposure and records findings, caveats and audit history.

    Not a recall decision system. Not certified. Not production-ready. One authored scenario; accuracy, time savings and customer demand remain
    unmeasured.

